              "stCode": "// Neutral Text Representation (FTDS Text-Based DSL)\nRUNG 0: XIC(Master_EStop_Healthy) XIC(Safety_LightCurtain_OK) XIC(Auto_Cycle_Start_PB) XIO(Cycle_Stop_PB) OTE(Infeed_Conveyor_Run);\nRUNG 1: XIC(Infeed_Conveyor_Run) XIC(Part_In_Position_PE) TON(Clamp_Settle_Tmr, 300, 0) OTE(Fixture_Clamp_Extend);\nRUNG 2: XIC(Fixture_Clamp_Extend) XIO(Robot_Welding_Active) OTE(Rtn_Local_Permissive);",
